      "source_text": "啊，真讨厌，真讨厌！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Oh, how awful, how awful!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p00539",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "在宴席上才见面，他们就说：那么明年在滑雪场上见吧。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "They have only just met at the banquet, and already they say, Well then, let us meet next year on the ski slopes.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p00539",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "今年不滑算了，再见。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Maybe I will skip skiing this year. Goodbye.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p00539",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "喂，小君，走吧！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Come on, Kimi, let us go!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p00539",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "今晚要下雪哩。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "It is going to snow tonight.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p00539",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "下雪前的头晚特别冷。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The night before snow falls is especially cold.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
